    "primary": "One agent may discover and use the customer launch plan, then author its exact reference through ordinary briefing activity. Another agent must exact-read it before using it for a different region. The gate passes only when at least two deliberate publications commit more delivery work than the registered launch capacity after each actor reads its own live regional quote."
